{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_165_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_165","textTraditional":"一、十有六年。春王正月，葬晉悼公。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_165_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_165","textTraditional":"二、三月，公會晉侯、宋公、衞侯、鄭伯、曹伯、莒子、邾婁子、薛伯、〈木巳〉伯、小邾婁子于湨梁。戊寅，大夫盟。晉人執莒子、邾婁子以歸。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_165_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_165","textTraditional":"諸侯皆在是，其言大夫盟何？信在大夫也。何言乎信在大夫？徧剌天下之大夫也。曷為遍剌天下之大夫？君若贅旒然。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_165_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_165","textTraditional":"三、齊侯伐我北鄙。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_165_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_165","textTraditional":"四、夏，公至自會。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_165_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_165","textTraditional":"五、五月甲子，地震。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_165_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_165","textTraditional":"六、叔老會鄭伯、晉荀偃、衞寗殖、宋人，伐許。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_165_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_165","textTraditional":"七、秋，齊侯伐我北鄙，圍成。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_165_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_165","textTraditional":"八、大雩。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_cdt_165_10","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_165","textTraditional":"九、冬，叔孫豹如晉。","sentenceOrder":10}],"overrides":{}}